WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:12.803
Everyone in Ed's family is a clown.

2
00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:15.171
Ed's grandfather is a clown.

3
00:00:15.172 --> 00:00:17.237
Ed's father is a clown.

4
00:00:17.238 --> 00:00:22.115
Ed's mother is a clown.

5
00:00:22.116 --> 00:00:24.772
Ed wants to be a clown too.

6
00:00:24.773 --> 00:00:27.199
Now Ed is seven years old.

7
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:32.127
He is going to clown school.

8
00:00:32.128 --> 00:00:36.989
"Ed, here's your school uniform," says his mother.

9
00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.916
Ed looks at his uniform.

10
00:00:38.917 --> 00:00:42.878
He is very surprised.

11
00:00:42.879 --> 00:00:44.697
The coat is too long.

12
00:00:44.698 --> 00:00:47.942
The pants are too short.

13
00:00:47.943 --> 00:00:50.502
The shoes are too big.

14
00:00:50.503 --> 00:00:55.193
The hat is too small.

15
00:00:55.194 --> 00:01:00.420
"Mom! My uniform doesn't fit," Ed says.

16
00:01:00.421 --> 00:01:04.307
Ed's mother looks at the clothes.

17
00:01:04.308 --> 00:01:06.425
"Everything is perfect.

18
00:01:06.426 --> 00:01:10.918
Let me help you," she says and smiles.

19
00:01:10.919 --> 00:01:13.885
"There you are, dear."

20
00:01:13.886 --> 00:01:15.844
She paints his face.

21
00:01:15.845 --> 00:01:18.660
His mouth is bigger.

22
00:01:18.661 --> 00:01:21.860
"Here is a tear under your eye.

23
00:01:21.861 --> 00:01:24.211
Here is a red nose.

24
00:01:24.212 --> 00:01:29.972
Here is a funny hat," says his mother.

25
00:01:29.973 --> 00:01:31.740
Ed looks in the mirror.

26
00:01:31.741 --> 00:01:35.113
He is very happy.

27
00:01:35.114 --> 00:01:38.618
"Am I a clown?" he asks.

28
00:01:38.619 --> 00:01:41.294
"No," says his mother.

29
00:01:41.295 --> 00:01:45.073
"You just look like a clown!"

30
00:01:45.074 --> 00:01:48.373
Ed walks to clown school with two smiles.

31
00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.112
One smile is painted.

32
00:01:50.113 --> 00:01:55.048
And one smile is real.
